{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-p049a","title":"孙权告天文陈受命登坛燎祭","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-p049a-account","label":"《吴录》","text":"孙权告天文陈受命登坛燎祭","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p049a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"告天","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p049a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":229,"label":"即帝位时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y229","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o084","basis":"即帝位时"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-p049a-q","wuzhu-q-o084","zhuge-q-o036","zhuge-q-b-2cd6c12d0155d7b41caf"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-p049a-q","source_order":[47,501,"P049a"],"order":8291}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-p049a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-4361be97a4ca5cf59d34","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《吴录》载权告天文曰：“皇帝臣权，敢用玄牡，昭告于皇皇后帝：汉享国二十有四世，历年四百三十有四；行气数终，禄祚运尽：普天弛绝，率土分崩。孽臣曹丕，遂夺神器；丕子叡，继世作慝，淫名乱制。权生于东南，遭值期运；承乾秉戎，志在平世；奉辞行罚，举足为民。群臣将相，州郡百城，执事之人，咸以为：‘天意已去于汉，汉氏已绝（祀）于天；皇帝位虚，郊祀无主；休征嘉瑞，前后杂沓；历数在躬，不得不受。’权畏天命，不敢不从。谨择元日，登坛燎祭，即皇帝位。惟尔有神飨之！左右有吴，永终天禄。”","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":500,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-54dc36bba183c955b60b","start":0,"end":237},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o084","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-83e35f5ca74d8a53a1d7","layer":"original","quote":"黄龙元年春，公卿百司皆劝权正尊号〖1〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":442,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-2cd6c12d0155d7b41caf","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-2cd6c12d0155d7b41caf","layer":"modern","quote":"〖21〗七年：建兴七年（公元 229）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6aef03116ccf2e720e54","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"zhuge-q-o036","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-019120a2568f2b0d74c9","layer":"original","quote":"七年〖21〗，亮遣陈式攻武都、阴平。魏雍州刺史郭淮率众欲击式，亮自出至建威〖22〗；淮退还，遂平二郡。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
